title: 6. Why Jeff hears only doors
pid: 13202324-4cca-4ffd-8fea-a6dcbdaa15fd
body: |2-
  It is Tay's rule, [[id:97eeb762-3b30-432a-ac67-ec052df492b7][Ask about what is to be built, and what is hard to reverse. Keep going on how.]]
  Decide on most of what you wish you knew, and write the decision down
  where he can find it and turn it around.
  First use: Jeff answered the one question that was a one-way door;
  Tay settled another as a two-way door, and the plan says it is his
  to reverse.
  Rests on: read (Bezos 2015: Type 1 and Type 2 decisions; Bezos 2016:
  decide on about 70% of the information, disagree and commit,
  escalate true misalignment early).
